Binding: init_rstudio
Title: Shiny Application using rhino
Icon: favicon.ico

Parameter: github_actions_ci
Widget: CheckboxInput
Label: Github Actions CI
Default: On

Parameter: agents_instructions
Widget: CheckboxInput
Label: AGENTS.md for AI coding agents
Default: On

Parameter: e2e_tests
Widget: CheckboxInput
Label: Cypress end-to-end tests
Default: On
